# Single-page fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# PrintNest keeps all of its state in memory and IndexedDB rather than in the
# URL, so there are no client-side routes to preserve — but a stray or shared
# deep link should still open the application rather than a 404.
#
# The 200 status rewrites rather than redirects, so the address bar is left
# alone. Real missing assets still 404 because they are matched first.
/*    /index.html   200
